;0.36</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">46</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">13cis-4-oxoRA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.06&#x000b1;0.03</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.09&#x000b1;0.02</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.22&#x000b1;0.09</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">AT-4-oxoRA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.44&#x000b1;0.12</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">11</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.07&#x000b1;0.05</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">13</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.39&#x000b1;0.72</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">45</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Tumour (<italic>&#x003bc;</italic>g&#x02009;g<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)<sup>a</sup></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">13cisRA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.07&#x000b1;0.07</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.28&#x000b1;0.07</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.15&#x000b1;0.03<